</span></span></code></pre><button type="button" class="button__gOWvd size-small__kT0Jp icon-only__5c-is color-secondary-white__AseI0 copy-button__uXOTd idle__1ofXr copy-button__nMsTD" aria-label="Copy" aria-describedby="_R_4u5l6kqcm_"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-clipboard-copy display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_t4u5l6kqcm_" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-clipboard-copy-16"></use></svg></button></div></div><h2 id="recover-secret-from-snapshot" class="hds-typography-display-500 hds-font-weight-bold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h2__9ZcX_"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow mdx-heading-permalink_h2__CA9g8" aria-label="recover secret from snapshot permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#recover-secret-from-snapshot"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Recover secret from snapshot <span class="enterprise-alert_root__mvEIF enterprise-alert_inline__IqpbC"><div class="badge__zns82 size-medium__xqCpO type-outlined__l0zjH color-neutral__6Csf4 enterprise-alert_badge___N2fV"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-vault-color display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_2q525l6kqcm_" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-vault-color-16"></use></svg><div class="text__WoM4W" aria-hidden="false">Enterprise</div></div></span></h2><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">Reads the secret at the specified path from a loaded snapshot and writes it to
live cluster storage as a new version. Vault only sources secret data from the
loaded snapshot. The request fails if <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">cas_required</code> is set to
<code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">true</code> on the key or engine configuration.
| Method    | Path                             |
<!-- -->|<!-- -->:----------<!-- -->|<!-- -->:---------------------------------<!-- -->|<!-- -->
<!-- -->|<!-- --> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">RECOVER</code> <!-- -->|<!-- --> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">/:secret-mount-path/data/:path</code> <!-- -->|</p><h3 id="path-parameters" class="hds-typography-display-400 hds-font-weight-bold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h3__xmS_z"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow mdx-heading-permalink_h3__SkrrS" aria-label="path parameters permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#path-parameters"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Path parameters</h3><ul class="mdx-lists_listRoot__iVDx9"><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="secret-mount-path-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#"></a><a aria-label="secret mount path permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#secret-mount-path-4"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">secret-mount-path</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &lt;required&gt;)</code> - The path to the KV mount, such
as <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">secret</code>.</li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="path-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#"></a><a aria-label="path permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#path-2"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">path</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &lt;required&gt;)</code> – The destination path for the recovered secret.</li></ul><h3 id="headers" class="hds-typography-display-400 hds-font-weight-bold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h3__xmS_z"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow mdx-heading-permalink_h3__SkrrS" aria-label="headers permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#headers"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Headers</h3><ul class="mdx-lists_listRoot__iVDx9"><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="x-vault-recover-snapshot-id" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#"></a><a aria-label="x vault recover snapshot id permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#x-vault-recover-snapshot-id"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">X-Vault-Recover-Snapshot-Id</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &lt;required&gt;)</code> – The ID of a snapshot
previously loaded into Vault that contains the secret at the provided path.</li><li class="mdx-lists_listItem__nkqhg"><a id="x-vault-recover-source-path" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __target-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#"></a><a aria-label="x vault recover source path permalink" class="inline-link_root__iIql6 g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular inline-link_primary__kGJLJ __permalink-lic" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#x-vault-recover-source-path"><code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">X-Vault-Recover-Source-Path</code></a> <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">(string: &quot;&quot;)</code> – Optional header specifying the
original <code class="mdx-inline-code_inlineCode__p_0sy mdx-inline-code_size-200__YiF_7 hds-typography-code-200">data/</code> path of the secret in the snapshot. Must be on the same mount
as the destination path.</li></ul><h3 id="sample-request-4" class="hds-typography-display-400 hds-font-weight-bold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h3__xmS_z"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow mdx-heading-permalink_h3__SkrrS" aria-label="sample request permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#sample-request-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Sample request</h3><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WLWxy language-shellsession mdx-code-blocks_codeBlockMargin__xk4yr"><div class="header__42Fek"></div><div class="body__pLFmP"><pre class="code__J06se" id="_R_5u5l6kqcm_" style="max-height:auto"><code><span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-cyan)">$</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)"> curl \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    --header &quot;X-Vault-Token: ...&quot; \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    --header &quot;X-Vault-Recover-Snapshot-Id: 9465df92-8236-4af9-8cc8-b7460d882e41&quot; \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    --request RECOVER \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    https://127.0.0.1:8200/v1/secret/data/my-secret</span></span>
</span></span></code></pre><button type="button" class="button__gOWvd size-small__kT0Jp icon-only__5c-is color-secondary-white__AseI0 copy-button__uXOTd idle__1ofXr copy-button__nMsTD" aria-label="Copy" aria-describedby="_R_5u5l6kqcm_"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-clipboard-copy display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_t5u5l6kqcm_" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-clipboard-copy-16"></use></svg></button></div></div><p class="text_root__r0DFB hds-typography-body-300 hds-font-weight-regular mdx-p_p__ZTJEA">To recover to a different path within the same mount:</p><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WLWxy language-shellsession mdx-code-blocks_codeBlockMargin__xk4yr"><div class="header__42Fek"></div><div class="body__pLFmP"><pre class="code__J06se" id="_R_665l6kqcm_" style="max-height:auto"><code><span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-cyan)">$</span><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)"> curl \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    --header &quot;X-Vault-Token: ${VAULT_TOKEN}&quot; \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    --header &quot;X-Vault-Recover-Snapshot-Id: 9465df92-8236-4af9-8cc8-b7460d882e41&quot; \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    --header &quot;X-Vault-Recover-Source-Path: secret/data/my-old-secret&quot; \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    --request RECOVER \</span></span>
</span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-highlight-last__qC6nm"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--code-block-color-token)">    ${VAULT_ADDR}/v1/secret/data/my-new-secret</span></span>
</span></span></code></pre><button type="button" class="button__gOWvd size-small__kT0Jp icon-only__5c-is color-secondary-white__AseI0 copy-button__uXOTd idle__1ofXr copy-button__nMsTD" aria-label="Copy" aria-describedby="_R_665l6kqcm_"><svg class="flight-icon__f6lPO flight-icon-clipboard-copy display-inline__ItStG" aria-hidden="true" fill="currentColor" id="_R_t665l6kqcm_" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/_next/static/media/svg-sprite.6d1623eb.svg#flight-clipboard-copy-16"></use></svg></button></div></div><h3 id="sample-response-3" class="hds-typography-display-400 hds-font-weight-bold mdx-headings_heading__M6qPe g-offset-scroll-margin-top mdx-headings_h3__xmS_z"><a class="mdx-heading-permalink_root__2oeix g-focus-ring-from-box-shadow mdx-heading-permalink_h3__SkrrS" aria-label="sample response permalink" href="/vault/api-docs/secret/kv/kv-v2#sample-response-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="mdx-heading-permalink_icon__Sz01O"><g fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.141 1a3.893 3.893 0 00-2.738 1.093L7.314 3.175A.75.75 0 008.372 4.24l1.077-1.07a2.393 2.393 0 013.384 3.382l-1.881 1.88a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.608-.258.75.75 0 00-1.202.899 3.893 3.893 0 005.87.42l1.886-1.886.01-.009A3.893 3.893 0 0011.14 1z"></path><path d="M7.019 5.365a3.893 3.893 0 00-3.032 1.13L2.102 8.382l-.01.01a3.893 3.893 0 005.505 5.504l1.084-1.084a.75.75 0 00-1.06-1.06l-1.07 1.07a2.393 2.393 0 01-3.384-3.384l1.881-1.88a2.393 2.393 0 013.609.258.75.75 0 101.2-.899A3.893 3.893 0 007.02 5.365z"></path></g></svg></a>Sample response</h3><div class="code-block__dOm6M dark__aBMo7 undefined is-standalone__WLWxy language-json mdx-code-blocks_codeBlockMargin__xk4yr"><div class="header__42Fek"></div><div class="body__pLFmP"><pre class="code__J06se" id="_R_6e5l6kqcm_" style="max-height:auto"><code><span><span class="line-of-code__mDztA line-highlight-first__OMDUP line-hi